      hu: ["Itt található Mozambik legmagasabb csúcsa, a Monte Binga (2436 m).", "A terület a Kelet-afrikai árokrendszer peremén fekszik.", "Az aranybányászat már több mint 500 éves múltra tekint vissza.", "Manica városa a Munhumutapa Birodalom fontos központja volt.", "Itt találhatók az ország legnagyobb fenyő- és eukaliptuszültetvényei.", "Az évi csapadékmennyiség gyakran meghaladja az 1500 mm-t."],
      ro: ["Include vârful Monte Binga, cel mai înalt punct din Mozambic (2436 m).", "Regiunea este integrată în sistemul de rift est-african.", "Exploatarea aurului este documentată de peste 500 de ani.", "Orașul Manica a fost un nod comercial al Imperiului Munhumutapa.", "Găzduiește cele mai mari plantații de pin și eucalipt din țară.", "Precipitațiile anuale depășesc frecvent pragul de 1500 mm."],
      en: ["Contains Mount Binga, Mozambique's highest peak at 2436 meters.", "The region is part of the East African Rift System escarpment.", "Gold mining has been active in the area for over 500 years.", "The city of Manica was a key center of the Munhumutapa Empire.", "It hosts the largest pine and eucalyptus plantations in the country.", "Annual rainfall often exceeds 1500 mm in the higher elevations."],
